OL,3,GNEWSAEx-DUP leader Donaldson to be
OL,4,Asentenced for child sex abuse including
OL,5,Arape
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,8,Fleader Jeffrey Donaldson is due to be
OL,9,Fsentenced for child sex abuse,
OL,10,Fincluding rape, on Thursday.
OL,12,FHe was convicted in June of 18 counts
OL,13,Fof sex abuse, which he committed
OL,14,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,15,Fchildren.
OL,17,FDonaldson was previously told by judge
OL,18,FPaul Ramsey that the sentence would be
OL,19,Fa lengthy one.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
