OL,3,GNEWSAEx-DUP leader Donaldson to be
OL,4,Asentenced for child sex abuse including
OL,5,Arape
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 63-year-old, who has been held in
OL,8,FMaghaberry Prison awaiting sentencing,
OL,9,Fis seeking to appeal his convictions.
